<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Actually,\'92 Sarah explained, \'91good champagne is very palatable at room temperature.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Shut the tax up,\'92 Eloise snapped then looked a little embarrassed about her outburst. \
