<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise shot her hand up to interrupt. \'91I\'92ll not hear any ill-conceived confessions.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91All I\'92m saying is, Sarah and Hayley did their best to prevent such an infraction.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise was far from mollified. \'91Then Hayley\'97a police officer\'97went and did it anyway.\'92\
