<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I\'92ll do it,\'92 Sarah said, resolving to ride this sandworm and master it. Hayley and Kathy stared at her, perplexed.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Do what?\'92 asked Eloise.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah swallowed. \'91I\'92ll marry.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Who?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Him.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I think you might need to be more explicit.\'92\
