<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Alexander?\'92 Eloise checked with mock surprise.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Yes, I\'92ll marry Alexander, okay, and I\'92ll come to work for you, and Little Clinton with become your sole heir.\'92\
