<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91No,\'92 Sarah said and tightened her lips. \'91I\'92m not giving in. I\'92m taking charge.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah\'92s resoluteness pleased Eloise so much, she beckoned the waiter over.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91But I have conditions,\'92 Sarah added, and all present understood she would not be taxed with.\
